 ],
 "notes": "The \"alias/aws/sns\" fallback literal is not checked on its own: real templates build the selection in a local, which neither the plan nor __declared__ exposes, so topic_kms_configured only requires that the topic sets a KMS key id. topic_provided_key_input no longer accepts any variable merely containing 'kms' and 'key' (create_kms_key matched) or the alias/aws/sns fallback; it needs the topic to read a variable or a key ARN/ID variable. The alias being derived from the topic name is not checked: it needs a cross-attribute string relation the interpreter cannot express. Optional KMS key and topic policy must be count/for_each-gated."
}
